    {
      "text": "Number three. Djed Spence, thirty-six point six two.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "person",
        "person": "spence",
        "label": "NUMBER 3 · 36.62",
        "mood": "happy"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Number two. Gabriel Martinelli, thirty-six point seven four, against Newcastle.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "person",
        "person": "martinelli",
        "label": "NUMBER 2 · 36.74",
        "mood": "happy"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "And number one, by a mile. Jackson Tchatchoua.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "person",
        "person": "tchatchoua",
        "label": "NUMBER 1",
        "mood": "shocked",
        "stamp": "37.30"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Thirty-seven point three kilometres an hour, against Everton. Only two runs in Premier League history have been faster.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "stats",
        "title": "Tchatchoua",
        "items": [
          {
            "n": "37.30",
            "l": "km/h v Everton"
          },
          {
            "n": "36.97",
            "l": "km/h v Palace"
          }
        ],
        "person": "tchatchoua"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "He was so fast he is also the number two run of the season.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "list",
        "title": "Fastest runs of 2025-26",
        "rows": [
          {
            "name": "Jackson Tchatchoua",
            "value": "37.30",
            "club": "wol",
            "hl": true
          },
          {
            "name": "Jackson Tchatchoua",
            "value": "36.97",
